        "text_C4qQj9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<h4>1. Information We Collect</h4><p>We collect personal information when you:</p><ul><li>Visit our website, subscribe to our newsletter, or interact with other features of the Site.</li><li>Place an order, create an account, or contact us for support.</li></ul><p><strong>Types of information collected include:</strong></p><ul><li>Personal details: Name, email address, phone number, shipping/billing address.</li><li>Transaction data: Payment details and order history.</li><li>Usage data: Information about how you interact with our Site.</li><li>Cookies: Small data files to improve your browsing experience (see Section 4).</li></ul><h4>2. How We Use Your Information</h4><p>We use your information to:</p><ul><li>Fulfill orders and provide customer support.</li><li>Improve the functionality and usability of our Site.</li><li>Communicate with you regarding your account, orders, or promotional offers (with your consent).</li><li>Comply with legal obligations.</li></ul><h4>3. Cookies</h4><p>Our Site uses cookies to enhance your experience. Cookies help us:</p><ul><li>Track site usage and improve performance.</li><li>Customize content and ads to better serve you.</li></ul><p><strong>Opting Out:</strong><br/>You can disable cookies in your browser settings. However, doing so may limit some features of the Site, including placing orders.</p><h4>4. Sharing Your Information</h4><p>We do not sell, rent, or share your personal information, except:</p><ul><li>To fulfill your orders (e.g., with shipping providers).</li><li>If required by law or to protect our legal rights.</li><li>With trusted third parties, such as payment processors, under strict confidentiality agreements.</li></ul><h4>5. Protecting Your Information</h4><p>We take appropriate security measures to protect your data from unauthorized access or misuse. However, no online transmission is entirely secure, and we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p><h4>6. Accessing or Updating Your Information</h4><p>You may request access to or corrections of your personal information by contacting us at <a><strong>hello@zephyra.com</strong></a>. Proof of identity may be required.</p><h4>7. Third-Party Websites</h4><p>Our Site may contain links to third-party websites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices, so please review their policies separately.</p><h4>8. Changes to This Policy</h4><p>We reserve the right to update this Privacy Policy at any time. Changes will be reflected by the \"Last Updated\" date at the top of this page. Continued use of our Site signifies acceptance of these changes.</p><h4>Contact Us</h4><p>For any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy, please contact us at:<br/><strong>Email:</strong> <a>hello@zephyra.com</a></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        }
      },
